  "description_replacements": {
    "Summon Air Elemental": "Five creatures with this action within 30 feet of each other can magically summon an air elemental. Each must use its action and movement on three consecutive turns to perform an aerial dance and maintain concentration as if concentrating on a spell. When all five finish, the elemental appears in an unoccupied space within 60 feet of them. It is friendly and obeys their spoken commands. It remains for 1 hour, until it or all its summoners die, or until a summoner dismisses it as a bonus action. A summoner cannot perform the dance again until it finishes a short rest. When the elemental returns to the Elemental Plane of Air, any creature with this action within 5 feet of it can return with it.",
    "Blessing of the Sea": "If this monster would be reduced to 0 hit points, its hit points instead reset to 350 and its Steam Breath recharges. It can then use its mythic actions for 1 hour."
